# https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs
Output demo.gif

Set Width 960
Set Height 500
Set FontSize 14
Set FontFamily "Menlo"
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 10ms
Set Padding 20

Type "ips -t 2 --ruby 3.4 --ruby 4.0 --ruby '4.0 --yjit' -e 'Object.new' -e 'Object.allocate'"
Sleep 250ms
Enter

Sleep 25s
